From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:35:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] ANGLE: video frames drawn at feature level 9_3 (W10M)

At 9_3 (zeroMaxLodWorkaround) every sampling of a texture first asks for its level-zero copy; an EGL image's storage answered UNREACHABLE, and every draw of a decoded video frame was refused (GL_INVALID_OPERATION, 2426 times in one Lumia 650 run). An EGL image is one level already: nothing to switch, so it answers Continue.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/TextureStorage11.cpp | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/third_party/angle/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/TextureStorage11.cpp b/third_party/angle/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/TextureStorage11.cpp
index 828454a2d81bc6e630d5160f1f7928e0bf1be972..3a276eb21b32a470a48a3699dd5623720d9b6237 100644
--- a/third_party/angle/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/TextureStorage11.cpp
+++ b/third_party/angle/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/TextureStorage11.cpp
@@ -1997,8 +1997,17 @@ angle::Result TextureStorage11_EGLImage::copyToStorage(const gl::Context *contex
 angle::Result TextureStorage11_EGLImage::useLevelZeroWorkaroundTexture(const gl::Context *context,
                                                                        bool)
 {
+#if defined(VENETIUM_W10M)
+    // Windows 10 Mobile: at feature level 9_3 (zeroMaxLodWorkaround) every sampling of a
+    // texture first asks for its level-zero copy. An EGL image -- a decoded video frame's BGRA
+    // copy here -- is one level of a texture that is not ANGLE's: it already is the level-zero
+    // texture, and there is nothing to switch to. UNREACHABLE refused every draw of a video
+    // frame at 9_3, and the video was not seen.
+    return angle::Result::Continue;
+#else
     ANGLE_HR_UNREACHABLE(GetImplAs<Context11>(context));
     return angle::Result::Stop;
+#endif
 }
 
 angle::Result TextureStorage11_EGLImage::getSwizzleTexture(const gl::Context *context,
